flowchart TD
  U[People's browsers and MCP clients]
  subgraph BOUNDARY[The organisation's boundary]
    P[Reverse proxy: ends TLS, the only way in]
    IDP[Identity provider]
    A[digin]
    LOG[Log collection, SIEM]
    MON[Monitoring]
  end
  EXT[Outside: only what is turned on]
  U -->|HTTPS| P
  P -->|HTTP, or mutual TLS| A
  A -->|OIDC sign-in| IDP
  IDP -->|SCIM, through the proxy| P
  A -->|JSON log lines| LOG
  MON -->|metrics, with a token| A
  A -->|HTTPS, to allow-lists| EXT
